# Goal section: starts the Receptionist action server workflow.
# Precaution: set summary_only to true only when all guest fields below are already known.
bool summary_only

# Replay section: when true, summary_only mode ignores all guest fields in this goal and reuses node memory.
# Precaution: this only works after one successful interview while receptionist_node.py is still running.
bool replay_last_profile

# Audio section: controls the microphone capture duration for interview mode.
# Precaution: record_sec is ignored when summary_only is true.
float32 record_sec

# Audio section: ALSA microphone device used by arecord during interview mode.
# Precaution: leave this as a valid ALSA device name, for example "default" or "plughw:1,0".
string mic_device

# TTS section: Piper voice model used for every spoken prompt and final summary.
# Precaution: final summary delivery fails if this path is empty or invalid.
string piper_model_path

# STT section: faster-whisper model name used during interview mode.
# Precaution: larger models improve recognition but increase CPU latency.
string whisper_model

# STT section: language hint used during interview mode.
# Precaution: use an empty string for auto-detection when the language is not fixed.
string whisper_language

# Summary-only section: known guest name for direct introduction.
# Precaution: this field is used only when summary_only is true.
string guest_name

# Summary-only section: known guest age for direct introduction.
# Precaution: use 0 when the age is unknown.
int32 guest_age

# Summary-only section: known guest gender for direct introduction.
# Precaution: use "male" or "female" when possible for standard RoboCup output.
string guest_gender

# Summary-only section: known favorite drink for direct introduction.
# Precaution: use the dataset drink spelling when possible, for example "orange juice".
string favorite_drink
---
# Result section: reports whether the receptionist workflow completed.
# Precaution: success means the action reached the requested delivery stage, not that every answer was heard.
bool success

# Result section: machine-readable error or operator-facing diagnostic.
# Precaution: empty string means no action-level error was detected.
string error

# Guest section: normalized guest name collected or introduced by the server.
# Precaution: empty string means the name was skipped or not provided.
string guest_name

# Guest section: normalized guest age collected or introduced by the server.
# Precaution: 0 means the age was skipped or not provided.
int32 guest_age

# Guest section: normalized guest gender collected or introduced by the server.
# Precaution: empty string means the gender was skipped or not provided.
string guest_gender

# Guest section: normalized favorite drink collected or introduced by the server.
# Precaution: empty string means the drink was skipped or not provided.
string favorite_drink

# Transcript section: raw speech transcript for the name answer.
# Precaution: empty string is expected in summary_only mode.
string raw_name

# Transcript section: raw speech transcript for the age answer.
# Precaution: empty string is expected in summary_only mode.
string raw_age

# Transcript section: raw speech transcript for the gender answer.
# Precaution: empty string is expected in summary_only mode.
string raw_gender

# Transcript section: raw speech transcript for the favorite-drink answer.
# Precaution: empty string is expected in summary_only mode.
string raw_drink

# Compatibility section: keeps older state-machine checks working during migration.
# Precaution: this is true when the receptionist action accepted the guest information flow.
bool arrived

# Compatibility section: keeps older handover checks working during migration.
# Precaution: this is true when the final guest information delivery was attempted.
bool handover_ok

# Compatibility section: mirrors the name transcript for older clients.
# Precaution: prefer raw_name in new code.
string transcript_arrived

# Compatibility section: mirrors the drink transcript for older clients.
# Precaution: prefer raw_drink in new code.
string transcript_handover

# Delivery section: exact final summary sentence sent to Piper.
# Precaution: log this field during tests to verify the robot speaks the expected guest information.
string final_summary
---
# Feedback section: current high-level receptionist stage.
# Precaution: clients should treat unknown stages as informational, not fatal.
string stage

# Feedback section: human-readable progress message.
# Precaution: this text is for logging and UI display only.
string info

# Feedback section: preview of the final summary when the FINAL_SUMMARY stage is reached.
# Precaution: this remains empty until the final delivery stage.
string final_summary
